message: "If you use NutriClinic in research or teaching, please cite it as below. Citation is requested; it is not an additional condition of the AGPL-3.0-only license."
type: software
title: "NutriClinic: clinical nutrition workspace"
abstract: "Clinician-supervised workspace for adult ICU and ward nutrition assessment: anthropometry, GLIM/ESPEN/NRS 2002 support, sarcopenia (EWGSOP2) and dysphagia records, laboratory import and clinic reference intervals, energy-protein planning, daily intake follow-up and a source-traceable evidence library. Research version; not clinically validated."
authors:
